 "limits": [
  "Particles, ribbons, lights, modern shader combiners and camera animation are dropped (see the report).",
  "Replaces the model for every display that uses it; native skin names are reused for the modern skins.",
  "Harvest golem (Westfall; CreatureModelData 71, displays 71/367/378/379/514/548/1150). The native model is missing from the data, so there is no template; creature/golemharvest/golemharvest.m2 (FileDataID 124235, byte-identical in Forever and Retail) is the classic geometry. Its BLPs are offline in the local Forever client (CascLib 4350), so the recipe reads Retail. Displays use HarvestGolemSkin<Color> (type 11, variation 0) and HarvestGolemBits<Color> (type 12, variation 1)."
 ]
